- model-service policy modules or compiled model-service builds when shipped as
  proprietary runtime components;
- license issuer, signing, release, registry, website, or customer-provisioning
  systems;
- private release or signing automation;
- optional optimizer, acceleration planner, aggregate/pocket matcher, exactness
  validator, aggregate/pocket rewrite, and related proprietary modules;
- compiled object code, container image layers, appliance images, VM images,
  hosted services, release bundles, or enterprise artifacts unless expressly
